{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship crash-landed in an alien jungle, and you barely escaped using your escape pod. Now, you'll have to cross the jungle to find a city where you can hopefully launch yourself back into space and find your way home again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by your trusty escape pod, you'll traverse 33 unique levels and face 3 epic bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a brick-breaker, like a cross between Pong and Arkanoid, you can play alone or coop with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCREEN TILT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Paddlenoid you'll have more control over your ball (your trusty escape pod) then it may at first seem. You can make a shot that seemed impossible, or ruin one that seemed in the bag, by tilting the screen and changing the trajectory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/475aef7e198d73192563de1cc11295a8.poster.avif?t=1761128510\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/475aef7e198d73192563de1cc11295a8.webm?t=1761128510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/475aef7e198d73192563de1cc11295a8.mp4?t=1761128510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PADDLE TILT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also tilt the paddle to aim the pod before releasing, or to give your pod some direction before you send it on it's way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/02678ca25320ee51b4d554a99a1274fd.poster.avif?t=1761128510\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/02678ca25320ee51b4d554a99a1274fd.webm?t=1761128510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/02678ca25320ee51b4d554a99a1274fd.mp4?t=1761128510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player or two-player local (couch) coop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt your paddles or tilt your screen to direct your escape pod.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 3, 5 or 7 pods in reserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different episode with a total of 33 levels and 3 boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story that has absolutely nothing more to it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're definitely not helping the alien fleet take control of our galaxy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OTHER FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any time during gameplay, press F1 to get help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press F8 to send feedback about anything your encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control the paddles with the mouse, keyboard or controller depending on your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paddle tilt can be disabled in the game options menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Fullscreen or in Windowed mode.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2789390?t=1761128510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/1e260b2ff108745b69558d07d3d6a83a99cae60c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761128510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/cf8ed463b892118b352f1b475dc898aed635e233/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761128510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/cf8ed463b892118b352f1b475dc898aed635e233/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761128510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship crash-landed in an alien jungle, and you barely escaped using your escape pod. Now, you'll have to cross the jungle to find a city where you can hopefully launch yourself back into space and find your way home again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by your trusty escape pod, you'll traverse 33 unique levels and face 3 epic bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a brick-breaker, like a cross between Pong and Arkanoid, you can play alone or coop with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCREEN TILT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Paddlenoid you'll have more control over your ball (your trusty escape pod) then it may at first seem. You can make a shot that seemed impossible, or ruin one that seemed in the bag, by tilting the screen and changing the trajectory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/475aef7e198d73192563de1cc11295a8.poster.avif?t=1761128510\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/475aef7e198d73192563de1cc11295a8.webm?t=1761128510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/475aef7e198d73192563de1cc11295a8.mp4?t=1761128510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PADDLE TILT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also tilt the paddle to aim the pod before releasing, or to give your pod some direction before you send it on it's way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/02678ca25320ee51b4d554a99a1274fd.poster.avif?t=1761128510\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/02678ca25320ee51b4d554a99a1274fd.webm?t=1761128510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/extras/02678ca25320ee51b4d554a99a1274fd.mp4?t=1761128510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player or two-player local (couch) coop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt your paddles or tilt your screen to direct your escape pod.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 3, 5 or 7 pods in reserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different episode with a total of 33 levels and 3 boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story that has absolutely nothing more to it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're definitely not helping the alien fleet take control of our galaxy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OTHER FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At any time during gameplay, press F1 to get help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press F8 to send feedback about anything your encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control the paddles with the mouse, keyboard or controller depending on your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paddle tilt can be disabled in the game options menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Fullscreen or in Windowed mode.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Deadbug Projects"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/69a8e00bbd8732fea0a5bee51a14656481d63bd2/header.jpg?t=1761128510","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Paddlenoid","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 7 / 8 / 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with at least 256MB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 7 / 8 / 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 GHz Dual Core CPU or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with at least 256MB of VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Deadbug Projects"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/0c2b59613